# obj_update on its own, with area_update, at the entrance to Mud School (3700). Smokegod (60) casts and sets
# timers short with `set obj`; Pupil (10) watches; Decimus (10) dies to leave a corpse.
# - a spring (2 ticks) dries up; two fireproofed swords' auras fade (msg_obj), one on the floor and one carried; a
#   potion evaporates and a scimitar crumbles; a pie a shopkeeper (6504, in 6535) has for sale goes quietly and
#   pays him a fifth of its cost; a floating disc, worn and carrying a scroll, flickers and vanishes and spills it
#   on the floor
# - a bag holding a bottle made just before it crumbles at the first tick and takes the bottle with it: the bottle
#   is next in object_list, so the C walks off into freed objects, and the rest of the list (the swords' auras
#   among them) waits a tick (sic, #85)
# - a drunk's corpse, with the bottle he carried, decays and takes the bottle with it
# - a fido's corpse put in a pit decays out of sight
# - Decimus's corpse decays and leaves what he carried on the floor
@updates area,obj
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3700
holylight
@connect pupil
Pupil
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer pupil 3700
transfer decimus 3700
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
cast 'create spring'
@pulse 24
set obj spring timer 2
@obj 3021 3700
get sword
cast fireproof sword
@pulse 24
drop sword
@obj 3021 3700
get sword
cast fireproof sword
@pulse 24
@obj 105 3700
set obj potion timer 2
@obj 3001 3700
@obj 3032 3700
get bottle
put bottle bag
set obj bag timer 1
@obj 3005 3700
set obj scimitar timer 3
cast 'floating disc'
@pulse 24
set obj disc timer 3
set obj pie timer 2
@obj 1362 3700
get scroll
put scroll disc
@as god
@mob 3064 3700
@obj 3001 3700
force drunk get bottle
slay drunk
@obj 3010 3700
@mob 3062 3700
slay fido
get corpse
put corpse pit
slay decimus
@state
@pulse 2400
@state
@pulse 2400
look
@state
@pulse 7200
look
@state
goto 6535
@state
